Synthetic fixtures for the "distro" alias miner (tests/aliases/distro/).

Written by hand in the extract formats of the arch_repos, pkgstats, debian and
debian_copyright collectors. No row is copied from a snapshot: the package
names, versions, URLs and counts are made up or are public facts (the names of
fonts and of the packages that ship them), chosen to exercise the miner's
rules. The Debian copyright rows are synthetic, as ruling T1 requires for
DEP-5 data (BRIEF item 12); two of them reproduce, with invented values, the
shape of a real DEP-5 mistake: a header's Upstream-Name copied from another
package. No personal data, e-mail address or token appears here.
